---
import AboutSocialLinks from "@/components/AboutSocialLinks.astro"
---

<section
  class="grid gap-8 border-b py-10 sm:py-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.8fr] lg:gap-12"
>
  <div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A bit about me</h2>
    <div
      class="mt-4 max-w-2xl space-y-3 text-base leading-6 text-muted-foreground"
    >
      <p>
        I’m a software engineer based in Australia with a passion for building
        useful things, exploring new places, and staying curious. I enjoy
        working with modern technologies, learning about infrastructure and
        cloud, and building personal projects outside of work.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I’m not coding, you’ll probably find me rock climbing, planning my
        next trip, playing games, or reading a good fantasy book.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started this blog as a way to document what I’m learning, share useful
        resources, and hopefully help others along the way.
      </p>
    </div>
    <AboutSocialLinks />
  </div>
  <div
    class="grid aspect-[4/3] place-items-center rounded-lg bg-muted text-muted-foreground"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Placeholder for a portrait"
  >
    <svg
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="size-28"
      viewBox="0 0 112 112"
      fill="none"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <circle cx="56" cy="36" r="21" fill="currentColor" opacity=".45"></circle>
      <path
        d="M23 89c0-18 15-29 33-29s33 11 33 29v5H23v-5Z"
        fill="currentColor"
        opacity=".45"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
